{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_01",
      "hash": "f39570eca3c31d1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：你可是来了！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_02",
      "hash": "f3956feca3c31b67",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "谢谢你的船票！\\n这游轮里不但宽敞，\\r\\n而且还有很多很多训练家……"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_01",
      "hash": "1b1bfc19f9bb010b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：Bonjour！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]和\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]都在是吗！\\r\\n没想到会在这里与你俩相遇啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_03",
      "hash": "f3956eeca3c319b4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：青绿哥哥！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_04",
      "hash": "f3956deca3c31801",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你是在乘船旅行吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_02",
      "hash": "1b1bfd19f9bb02be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：没有没有。\\c\\n我是被邀请来参加游轮派对的。\\n不过现在正准备走！\\c\\n我买了好多土产呢！\\n要不也分你一个吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0410_system_01",
      "hash": "e66cedb289b19491",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从青绿那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]娑罗沙布蕾[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_03",
      "hash": "1b1bfe19f9bb0471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：比起这个……\\n我在派对上听到个传言，\\c\\n你们知道“火箭队”吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0410_select_01",
      "hash": "df9b2d484fb661a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是一群坏蛋！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0410_select_02",
      "hash": "df9b2c484fb65ff3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "之前和他们对战了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_04",
      "hash": "1b1bff19f9bb0624",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：是啊……\\n看来传闻已经传开了啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_05",
      "hash": "1b1c0019f9bb07d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：真的假的！\\n你胆子挺大啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_06",
      "hash": "1b1c0119f9bb098a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……总而言之，\\n据说火箭队是利用宝可梦\\r\\n谋取暴利的危险组织！\\c\\n我会好好调查一下的。\\n……你们也要小心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_05",
      "hash": "f3956ceca3c3164e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：火箭队是嘛……\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，如果下次那些家伙\\n再来找你麻烦，记得通知我啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_06",
      "hash": "f3956beca3c3149b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：青绿哥哥\\n可是非常厉害的哦！\\c\\n听说他很多年前就\\n战胜了宝可梦联盟的四天王！\\c\\n不过，我听说他曾经\\n败给了他的劲敌呢！\\r\\n估计会厉害到无法想象啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d0303",
      "hash": "a8d7eed43e76e7e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
    },
    {
